@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 10. Exception Handling (Agentic Layer)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

class SessionAuthException
class PlanningException
class ToolExecutionException
class ResponseComposeException

class HumanMessageService
class GlobalErrorMapper
class SecurityAuditLogger

GlobalErrorMapper --> HumanMessageService
GlobalErrorMapper --> SecurityAuditLogger

HumanMessageService --> SessionAuthException
GlobalErrorMapper --> PlanningException
GlobalErrorMapper --> ToolExecutionException
GlobalErrorMapper --> ResponseComposeException

note right of HumanMessageService
Auth failure
permission failure
missing required input
returns HUMAN_MESSAGE
end note

note bottom of GlobalErrorMapper
Do not leak
- stack trace
- token
- session internal data
- raw tool payload
end note

@enduml
